nd for EVs fell in the U.S., where the Trump administration has pulled incentives for buyers. :: $108.4 billionAnd $108.4 billion was the hostile bid Warner Bros Discovery turned down from Paramount Skydance. Warner's board argued Paramount's offer misled shareholders over its financing. It argued the offer was 'inferior' to a merger agreement it already had in place with Netflix.Whoever wins the bidding war will get hold of popular film franchises like 'Harry Potter' and 'DC Comics'.	2025-12-20 11:03:12.999209+00
